{20480}{Lloyd Gurloes, the local blacksmith in Shrouded Hills, is rumored to do very good work.}
{20481}{If you're in need of a good blacksmith, Lloyd Gurloes is the man to see.}

{20500}{You hear what happened to that magick user that tried to throw his weight around here? Doc Roberts brought him down with a shot between the eyes!}
